{"id":696,"date":"2021-02-12T18:28:02","date_gmt":"2021-02-12T23:28:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.fm1.dev\/?page_id=696"},"modified":"2025-08-12T16:45:20","modified_gmt":"2025-08-12T20:45:20","slug":"hearing-up-network","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/x-about-us\/hearing-up-network\/","title":{"rendered":"Hearing Up Network\u00a0"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dr. Alexandra Tarvin is a Proud Member of the Hearing Up Network<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Recognized and interviewed by Audiologist and YouTuber Dr. Cliff Olson for best practices in the industry, our team stands ready to use our skills and experience to help each new and current patient with their own hearing success story.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We believe that following best industry practices ensures a stronger relationship between patient and provider, which helps lead to better outcomes daily.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u201cAs a fellow audiologist, I appreciate that Dr. Cliff has found a way to engage with our patient base and inform them of relevant and honest information that can help them make informed decisions. As a constant learner myself, this is a great way to inform my community that an amazing audiologist that cares about them and provides best practice is in their neighborhood.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Dr. Alexandra Tarvin, Au.D., when asked why she joined the Hearing Up Network (hearingup.com)<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/hearingup.com\/providers\/alexandra-tarvin-aud\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/hearingup.com\/providers\/alexandra-tarvin-aud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">To learn more about the Hearing Up Network&nbsp; and Dr. Tarvin\u2019s involvement, click here.<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:74px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"855\" height=\"255\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/hearingupphotocollage1.avif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32614\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/hearingupphotocollage1.avif 855w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/hearingupphotocollage1-768x229.jpg 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/hearingupphotocollage1-600x179.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 855px) 100vw, 855px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About the Hearing Up Network&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Launched by Dr. Olson, audiologist and founder of Applied Hearing Solutions in Phoenix, Arizona, the Dr. Cliff Au.D. network combines several audiologists who believe in the Hearing Up approach in audiology care. Olson and the Dr. Cliff Au.D. Network hand picks audiologists from across the country who meet the standards of his proven methods.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ready to succeed with your own hearing goals and witness the Hearing Up difference for yourself? <a href=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/x-about-us\/location\/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"115\">Call us to schedule an appointment with Dr. Tarvin at Elevate Audiology today!<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:66px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"421\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/hearingup.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-31174\" style=\"aspect-ratio:2.857142857142857;width:287px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/hearingup.jpeg 1200w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/hearingup-768x269.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/hearingup-600x211.jpeg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Patient Reviews<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-fuel-carousel fm-carousel vertical has-bullets hear-nw-carousel\" style=\"--autoSpeed:0.3s;--easing:ease;--num:2;--gap:1.5rem\"><button class=\"fm-nav-arrow fm-prev\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\"><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 34\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M22 4 9 17l13 13-4 4L1 17 18 0l4 4Z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/button><span class=\"fm-counter\" aria-live=\"assertive\"><\/span><div class=\"fm-carousel-overflow\"><ul class=\"fm-carousel-container\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<li class=\"wp-block-fuel-carousel-slide custom-slide\" id=\"4dwnm9434zdq4vqvq6hx5e\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--focalPoint:50% 15%\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Dr.&nbsp;Tarvin&nbsp;and doctoral resident Khori Cioli conducted my hearing evaluation. The evaluation itself was MUCH more comprehensive than the two hearing &#8216;evaluations&#8217; I had performed at other establishments.&nbsp;Dr.&nbsp;Tarvin&nbsp;then spent a considerable amount of time going over the evaluation results and explaining my specific hearing loss and tinnitus. Her expertise was apparent from the start and her ability to concisely and clearly explain the test results and the treatments and solutions available was shockingly refreshing and helpful. The discussion with&nbsp;Dr.&nbsp;Tarvin&nbsp;was one of the best I&#8217;ve had in 56 years of interactions with a doctor of any kind. She was professional, caring, positive &#8211; just one of the BEST. I couldn&#8217;t recommend anyone more highly.<\/p>\n<cite><strong>Thomas F. &#8211; July 22, 2024<\/strong><\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"wp-block-fuel-carousel-slide custom-slide\" id=\"t1le20witg488b7abrodg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--focalPoint:48% 24%\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>What purchasing a hearing aid should be. Elevate listened to me and my hearing difficulties. You did not try to just sell the most expensive but to make my hearing the best it can be. This is what professional service is all about. An A plus to you and your organization.<\/p>\n<cite><strong>William H. &#8211; September 5, 2024<\/strong><\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"wp-block-fuel-carousel-slide custom-slide\" id=\"t1le20witg488b7abrodg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--focalPoint:48% 24%\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Drs.&nbsp;Tarvin&nbsp;and Ooms are knowledgeable, thoughtful and kind. Every visit is fun and full of useful information. I appreciate them so much and assure anyone considering an audiologist, \u201cYou will be happy you chose Elevate.\u201d<\/p>\n<cite><strong>Winford G. &#8211; August 3, 2024<\/strong><\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"wp-block-fuel-carousel-slide custom-slide\" id=\"t1le20witg488b7abrodg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--focalPoint:48% 24%\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Everyone was extremely helpful and very professional. I would recommend Elevate to anyone who needs a hearing device, or if you are having hearing problems. Great group of Ladies. Thank you for your help.<\/p>\n<cite><strong>Susan B. &#8211; September 3, 2024<\/strong><\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"wp-block-fuel-carousel-slide custom-slide\" id=\"kd9cwz1u5krfd6uunqeefc\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--focalPoint:50% 15%\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>The people were very helpful and had much more information than an ENT center I recently saw about my tinnitus and explained my condition in great detail. They also explained therapy methods clearly. I consider this center has been the greatest help with my tinnitus than anyone else or any other source including what literature I was able to find or even the internet.<\/p>\n<cite><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><br><strong>Ronald S. &#8211; August 1, 2024<\/strong><\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"wp-block-fuel-carousel-slide custom-slide\" id=\"kd9cwz1u5krfd6uunqeefc\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--focalPoint:50% 15%\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>I have worn hearing aids for many years. I noticed my hearing in the last year has gotten worse. I was recommended to Elevate by a friend. The staff is friendly and professional. I received the most thorough evaluation I have ever had.&nbsp;Dr.&nbsp;Tarvinspent almost two hours with me, listening and giving me my options. I highly recommend them to you.<\/p>\n<cite><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><br><strong><strong>Christine G. &#8211; August 24, 2024<\/strong><\/strong><\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"wp-block-fuel-carousel-slide custom-slide\" id=\"kd9cwz1u5krfd6uunqeefc\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--focalPoint:50% 15%\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>I recently purchased new hearing aids from&nbsp;Dr.&nbsp;Tarvin. She is so amazingly professional yet so warm and kind. The whole experience with her and her staff and facility are the best and it was beyond comparison. I can&#8217;t thank her enough. If you are looking for the best, she is the best!!!<\/p>\n<cite><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><br><strong><strong><strong>Tom M. &#8211; August 10, 2024<\/strong><\/strong><\/strong><\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"wp-block-fuel-carousel-slide custom-slide\" id=\"kd9cwz1u5krfd6uunqeefc\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--focalPoint:50% 15%\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>If you are hearing impaired, it can be a challenge to learn to hear again. The obstacles you encounter after deciding to get help are huge, but not insurmountable. I reached out to&nbsp;Dr. Alexander&nbsp;Tarvin&nbsp;and her team at Elevate Audiology. You get an audiogram, exam, fitting, and ear molds if necessary, and Real Ear Measurement. Choosing the right people to guide you through these decisions will save you time, aggravation, and even money. Performance levels in Widex go from 110, 220, 330, and 440. The 440 has the most channels, but more importantly the most sound classes (or hearing environments). I required ear molds and&nbsp;Dr&nbsp;Tarvin&nbsp;is the only one I know who uses a laser system to have them made, instead of using a molding gel injected into your ears and then sent to the lab. I imagine most will run into some kind of problem either with the bluetooth, the app, the program, or some special need. Widex has a team you can call and I spent about 30 minutes on two occasions and they resolved my problems. My other problem and concerns were addressed by&nbsp;Dr&nbsp;Tarvin. 30 days after my first visit I am what you call a happy camper and I have&nbsp;Dr&nbsp;Tarvin&nbsp;and her staff to thank for that.<\/p>\n<cite><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><br><strong><strong><strong><strong>Carey K. &#8211; 3\/20\/2024<\/strong><\/strong><\/strong><\/strong><\/cite><\/blockquote>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul><\/div><button class=\"fm-nav-arrow fm-next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 34\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m0 30 13-13L0 4l4-4 17 17L4 34l-4-4Z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/button><ul class=\"fm-carousel-bullets\"><li><button class=\"fm-autoplay-control disabled\" aria-label=\"stop carousel\">\uffed<\/button><\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Dr. Alexandra Tarvin is a Proud Member of the Hearing Up Network Recognized and interviewed by Audiologist and YouTuber Dr. Cliff Olson for best practices in the industry, our team stands ready to use our skills and experience to help each new and current patient wi